{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Lava Eel is a ",["l","鱼","fish"]," that can be caught during all times and seasons in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," on the 100th floor and at the ",["l","锻造","Volcano Caldera"],". It is the only fish that can spawn in lava."]],["p",["In the Mines, the chances of hooking a Lava Eel depends on fishing level and equipment of the farmer, as well as the ",["l","钓鱼","distance from land"]," of the fished tile. The base chance of hooking a Lava Eel is 1.8%, which is increased by 0.32% per Fishing Level and 0.08% per tile from land. This is increased by a further 4% if a ",["l","珍稀诱钩","Curiosity Lure"]," is equipped, and by 8% if ",["l","针对性鱼饵","Lava Eel Bait"]," is equipped. For example, with a Fishing Level of 10 and 5 tiles from land, the chance of hooking a Lava Eel is 5.4%. This increases to 9.4% with a Curiosity Lure equipped, to 13.4% with Lava Eel Bait equipped, and to 17.4% with both a Curiosity Lure and Lava Eel Bait equipped."]],["p",["At the Volcano Caldera, the percent chance of hooking a Lava Eel is equivalent to 10 times the ",["l","钓鱼","distance from land"]," of the spot fished, assuming the ",["l","《物理101》","'Physics 101'"]," painting was not caught. For example, there is a 50% chance to hook a Lava Eel if the bobber lands 5 tiles from land."]],["p",["Of the non-",["l","鱼","legendary fish"],", it is the fish with the highest sell price and the second highest difficulty fish (after ",["l","章鱼","Octopus"],", tied with the ",["l","蝎鲤鱼","Scorpion Carp"],")."]]]],["Map",2,[["p",["The Lava Eel can be found in the Mines and at the Volcano Caldera."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","矮人","Dwarf"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Lava Eel is an option in the Master Fishers Bundle."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","生鱼寿司","Maki Roll"]],["Fish and rice wrapped in seaweed."],[["f","Fish.png",24]," Any ",["l","鱼","Fish"]," (1)",["i","(O)152","Seaweed ×1"],["i","(O)423","Rice ×1"]],["Energy 100\nHealth 45"],["The Queen of Sauce (21 Summer, Year 1)\n ",["f","Gus_Icon.png",22]," ",["l","星之果实酒吧","Stardrop Saloon"]," for 300g"],["220g"]],[[["l","高级肥料","Quality Fertilizer"]],["Improves soil quality, increasing your chance to grow quality crops. Mix into tilled soil."],[["i","(O)92","Sap ×4"],["f","Fish.png",24]," Any ",["l","鱼","Fish"]," (1)"],["N/A"],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 9"],["10g"]],[[["l","生鱼片","Sashimi"]],["Raw fish sliced into thin pieces."],[["f","Fish.png",24]," Any ",["l","鱼","Fish"]," (1)"],["Energy 75\nHealth 33"],[["l","莱纳斯","Linus"]," (Mail - 3+ ❤)"],["75g"]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Lava Eel is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["i","(H)45","Logo Cap"],". It can also be used as a red dye color at the dye pots in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, located at ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Fish Pond",2,[["p",["Lava Eels can be placed in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],", where they will reproduce every 5 days. The initial pond capacity is 1 fish, but the capacity can be increased to 10 by completing four quests. After the first quest is completed, the color of the pond water changes to red. The primary output is red Lava Eel ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"],", but ",["l","黄金矿石","Gold Ore"]," is possible starting at population 3 and several more valuable items are possible starting at population 8."]],["p",[["l","鱼塘","Quests"]]],["t",[[{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Pond Capacity"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Quest Item"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Fishing XP Granted"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Before Quest"]},{"h":1,"v":["After Quest"]}],[["1"],["3"],["3 ",["l","火水晶","Fire Quartz"]],["45"]],[["3"],["5"],["1 ",["l","玄武岩","Basalt"],", 2 ",["l","钻石","Diamond"],"s, or 1 ",["l","矮人卷轴 III","Dwarf Scroll III"]],["45"]],[["5"],["7"],["2 ",["l","超级炸弹","Mega Bomb"],"s"],["45"]],[["7"],["10"],["1 ",["l","铱锭","Iridium Bar"]],["45"]]]],["p",[["l","鱼塘","Produce"]]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Item(s) Produced"]},{"h":1,"v":["Fishing XP Granted"]},{"h":1,"v":["Population"]},{"h":1,"v":["% of Items"]},{"h":1,"v":["Overall Daily Chance"]}],[{"r":6,"v":[["l","鱼籽","Roe ×1"]]},{"r":6,"v":["25"]},["1-2"],["80%"],["18-25%"]],[["3-5"],["72%"],["28-40%"]],[["6-7"],["90%"],["57-64%"]],[["8"],["86%"],["68%"]],[["9"],["67%"],["58%"]],[["10"],["62%"],["59%"]],[{"r":2,"v":[["l","鱼籽","Roe ×2"]]},{"r":2,"v":["25"]},["9"],["14%"],["12%"]],[["10"],["13%"],["12%"]],[{"r":2,"v":[["l","鱼籽","Roe ×3"]]},{"r":2,"v":["25"]},["9"],["3.1%"],["2.7%"]],[["10"],["2.9%"],["2.7%"]],[{"r":4,"v":[["i","(O)384","Gold Ore ×5"]]},{"r":4,"v":["11"]},["3-7"],["10%"],["4-7%"]],[["8"],["9.6%"],["7.6%"]],[["9"],["7.4%"],["6.4%"]],[["10"],["6.9%"],["6.5%"]],[{"r":3,"v":[["i","(O)CaveJelly","Cave Jelly ×1"]]},{"r":3,"v":["17"]},["8"],["4%"],["3.2%"]],[["9"],["3.1%"],["2.7%"]],[["10"],["2.9%"],["2.7%"]],[[["i","(O)CaveJelly","Cave Jelly ×3"]],["17"],["10"],["3.9%"],["3.7%"]],[{"r":2,"v":[["i","(O)226","Spicy Eel